<title>UNITED NATIONS: British envoy is U.N. council president for August.</title>
<headline>British envoy is U.N. council president for August.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's U.N. representative, ambassador Sir John Weston, takes over as president of the Security Council Friday, succeeding ambassador Peter Osvald of Sweden.</p>
<p>The post rotates monthly among the council's 15 member delegations.</p>
